## Apple Human Interface Guidelines

- https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines
- Used as principles and acceptance criteria only (44 pt touch targets, 4.5:1
  text contrast, the two-layer model and the material variants, reduce motion,
  dynamic type). No text is reproduced in this repository.

## Icons

The 21 icons in `src/icon.rs` are this project's own SVG drawings of simple
geometric shapes (chevrons, a magnifier, a checkmark and similar). They are not
Apple's SF Symbols and contain none of Apple's artwork.
